window.products.push({"id":290039,"name":"FUTURELAB Temperature Control Coffee Mug, Multi-Functional Travel Mug with 14400mah Power Bank, Vacuum Insulated Hot Beverage Warmer, 10OZ (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Bv7p6akrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【No Additional Power Required】:When you want a cup of hot coffee, you don't need to look for additional power. The heated travel mug is able to heat your drinks anytime and anywhere. When traveling or going out, if you need to make tea or instant coffee, just bring this battery heated coffee mug. 【Powerful Performance】:Once charged, it can be heated to 185℉ (85 ℃) twice,131℉(55 ℃) for four times, and cold water can be heated within 10 minutes. When pouring the hot drink, and the constant temperature at 185℉(85 ℃) can last 9 hours, and it can reach 16 hours when the constant temperature is at 131℉(55 ℃) . Select the temperature you like. Its adjustable range is between 86℉ (30 ℃) and 185℉(85 ℃). The smart temperature control mug will automatically remember the temperature set last time. 【Not Just a Mug】:In order to make your travel more secure, we even design the power bank function for the cup in case of emergency.The Type-C charge port of our self-heating cup not only could charge but also can output power.All you need is take a OTG cable with you and the cup could charge your phone in an emergency. 【Healthy and Safe】:When there is no water or the inclination angle exceeds 45 °, it will automatically stops heating, which can prevent dry burning and other dangerous behaviors. The mug cover with a safety lock can prevent heating the mug when it is opened by accident. Food grade PP mug cover and 316 stainless steel vacuum insulation liner are used. The heated thermos mug has excellent thermal insulation and cold insulation function. 【Perfect Gift】:The Temperature Control Coffee Mug have exquisite shape design, practical product functions and applicable to almost all scenes. Lots advantages make our product an ideal gift, it can warm a cup of hot drinks for your friends who love to travel, it can provide your loved one with warm coffee all day for work time, it can provide parents with hot tea anytime and anywhere. 【No Worry Buying】:We provide a six month warranty service, no matter any questions or problems please contact our patient customer service. We have a professional customer service team to save you the last bit of worry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Bv7p6akrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FUTURELAB","source_asin":"B09JJWL82B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-290039","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JJWL82B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JJWL82B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
