window.products.push({"id":290225,"name":"Karu!jiku Mini kakejiku Japanese Scroll Wall Art AMABIE A9779 15x53cm Tapestry Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ScFi8amEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"An amabie appeared in Higo Province (Kumamoto Prefecture) according to legend, around the middle of the fourth month, in the year Kōka-3 (mid-May 1846) in the Edo era. A glowing object had been spotted in the sea, almost on a nightly basis. The town's officer went to the coast to investigate and witnessed the amabie. According to the sketch made by this official, it had long hair, a mouth like bird's bill was covered in scales from the neck down, and three-legged. Addressing the official, it identified itself as an amabie and told him that it lived in the open sea. It went on to deliver a prophecy: \"Good harvest will continue for six years from the current year;[a] if disease spreads, show a picture of me to those who fall ill and they will be cured.\" Afterwards, it returned to the sea. The story was printed in the kawaraban (woodblock-printed bulletins), where its portrait was printed, and this is how the story disseminated in Japan.A kakejiku, which is also called a kakemono, is a scroll that is mainly hung on the wall of the tokonoma (alcove). The hanging scrolls have great influence upon the atmosphere of the rooms where they are displayed. For this reason, people chose a painting or a work of calligraphy that they admire or that is appropriate to the season. Generally, they replace the hanging scroll with a different one when the seasons change or when they have guests. A pair of harmonious cranes snuggle against each other with their back? against the rising sun, which has been a sacred symbol of nature, life and hope since ancient times in Japan. This painting is decorated in all kinds of auspicious occasions, blessing the couples for health, longevity and great success of the whole family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ScFi8amEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Karu!jiku","source_asin":"B087N1FW8Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-290225","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087N1FW8Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087N1FW8Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
