window.products.push({"id":290234,"name":"Chic Home Halpert 6 Piece Comforter Set, King, Navy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WMqRps+9S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Inspired by high end designer wedding gowns and intricate details, Our designers couldn't help themselves by passing up this opportunity to deliver such a gorgeous design. The ruffling details which are finished by hand, the floral pinch pleat design is so well crafted and so luxurious it seriously is masterpiece of elegant decor. Included are embroidered pillows to complete the look. Composed of luxury grade super soft brushed microfiber polyester fabric. This bedding set is truly something to treasure. Queen/King Set includes: 1 Comforter, 1 Piece Bed skirt, 2 Piece Shams, 1 Piece Square Dec Pillow, 1 Piece Dec Pillow Style: Vintage Fabric detail: Microfiber Pattern: Ruffled Color options: White, Lavender, Silver, Taupe, Navy, Purple Materials: Polyester Fill material: Polyester Care instruction: Machine washable, use front loader machine (or top loader without agitator), use Cold water in gentle cycle, tumble dry low heat, adding 2 tennis balls in the dryer will add fluffiness. King dimensions: 1 Comforter: 110\"x92\" 1 Bed Skirt: 78\"x80\"+14\" 2 Shams 20\"x36\" 1 Decorative pillows: 12\"x18\" 1 Decorative pillows: 18\"x18\" Queen dimensions: 1 Comforter: 90\"x90\" 1 Bed Skirt: 60\"x80\"+14\" 2 Shams: 20\"x26\" 1 Decorative pillows: 12\"x18\" 1 Decorative pillows: 18\"x18\" The digital images we display have the most accurate color possible. However, due to differences in computer monitors, we cannot be responsible for variations in color between the actual product and your screen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WMqRps+9S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chic Home","source_asin":"B01I72JAGC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-290234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01I72JAGC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01I72JAGC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
