window.products.push({"id":290282,"name":"RahTune Silence is Golden Thinker Statue, Creative Abstract Figurine, Handcraft Resin Sculptures Decorative Objects for Entrance, Creative Room Home, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61q5H49xkaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<p>GREAT CONVERSATION STARTER - It's no coincidence that the words listen and silent share so many letters - to practice one is to embrace the other. This beautiful abstract statue celebrates the power of pausing and absorbing the thoughts and ideas of others to make a more balanced decision, to observe the truth in any situation.</p> <p>ELEVATE THE LOOK OF YOUR HOME - With a high-quality finish, this resin material statue depicts a floating face with a finger pressed to its lips, the universal symbol of let's stop a moment and listen.</p> <p>REMIND YOURSELF TO TAKE A BREAK ONCE IN A WHILE - A wonderful artistic reminder to take a break every once in a while and head the advice and stories of your friends, colleagues, and loved ones.</p> <p>CLEVER GIFT FOR A FRIEND OR LOVED ONE - This statue looks particularly striking when displayed on a desk or bookshelf. A clever gift for a friend or loved one hat values the power of silence and the wisdom of gathering one's thoughts before speaking.</p> <p>SIZE, MATERIAL & COLOR - Made of high-quality lightweight resin, this Silence is Golden abstract art statue measures approximately 4.7” x 4.3” x 13.5”- perfect for smaller shelves. This beautifully rendered sculpture features a face holding a single finger to their lips, finished in either gold, black or white color.</p>","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61q5H49xkaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RahTune","source_asin":"B098R275F6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-290282","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098R275F6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098R275F6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":290283,"name":"MALOUF 600 Thread Count Egyptian Cotton Single Ply Bed Sheet Set-Cal King-Silver Sage, California","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612lQp8GbpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Authentic Egyptian Cotton This product is 100% authentic, single-ply, single-pick, long-staple Egyptian cotton. Yes, there was a lot we had to clarify there because there are several ways other brands try to deceive consumers. Egyptian cotton is superior to most other sheet material because of the long-staple. While the long-staple can be found in other cottons, it is most predominantly found in Egyptian grown cotton. This long-staple allows the cotton to be woven more extensively, creating a softer and more durable sheet that is resistant to pilling. The carefully crafted weave makes Egyptian cotton sheets more breathable. You can see why authentic Egyptian cotton sheets are so desirable; unfortunately, a lot of consumers are tricked into purchasing inferior products. Most Oversized Dimensions MALOUF manufactures their linens to the most oversized dimensions available. Fitted sheets accommodate mattress depths from 6 to 22 inches, perfect for thick mattresses or beds with mattress toppers. The ultra-thick fitted sheet elastic goes all the way around the mattress to guarantee a secure fit. Superb Workmanship MALOUF's Egyptian cotton is finely woven to produce a true 600 thread count, but thread count alone is not the best way to measure Egyptian cotton quality. Designed in the U.S., imported materials were used to provide the highest levels of quality and comfort. Available in white, ivory, khaki, chocolate, silver sage, and slate.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612lQp8GbpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MALOUF","source_asin":"B004N4L3SW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-290283","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004N4L3SW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004N4L3SW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
