window.products.push({"id":290335,"name":"Ritz Kitchen Wears Print Thumb Mitt, Rooster and Teacups","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hVmNPzbEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description These RITZ Quilted Printed Oven Mitts are a great addition to your kitchen. Made from durable 100-percent cotton, these printed thumb mitts will add a pop of color to any kitchen decor. Machine wash in cold water and tumble dry low. Features: Right and Left Handed. Built for use on both the right and left hands. Right and Left Handed. Built for use on both the right and left hands. Coordinate Your Kitchen Decor. Various prints and colors to coordinate with your home decor. Coordinate Your Kitchen Decor. Various prints and colors to coordinate with your home decor. Durable Materials. Constructed from 100% cotton and terry lining for added heat protection. Durable Materials. Constructed from 100% cotton and terry lining for added heat protection. Complete the Collection. Coordinate this oven mitt with the matching aprons, towels, pot holders, and more. Complete the Collection. Coordinate this oven mitt with the matching aprons, towels, pot holders, and more. Measurements. 13\" long. Measurements. 13\" long. Why RITZ? Established in 1892, the John Ritzenthaler company (RITZ) has long been synonymous with the finest quality in home textiles. Today, the John Ritzenthaler company is a privately owned manufacturer, wholesaler and distributor of a complete line of high quality, color coordinated, fashion basic and designer bath and kitchen textiles, as well as, specialty laundry and cleaning aids. As a leader in the home textiles category we are experienced in working on RITZ initiated design concepts, licensed designs and also with interpreting customer requests into new products. Our marketing and design teams work closely together to identify product opportunities within the marketplace to help create the right product mix for our customers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hVmNPzbEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ritz","source_asin":"B0097NG4H4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-290335","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0097NG4H4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0097NG4H4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
