window.products.push({"id":290506,"name":"Qianfenie 32 oz Glass Jars with Airtight Lids, Mason Jars with Clip Top Lids for Kitchen - Square Glass Jars with Labels & Chalkboard Pen and Replacem","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ioabRGvlL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Qianfenie's Story I picked up a glass jar that had been abandoned for a long time, and began to dress up carefully, wipe it clean, draw patterns and put labels on it. What a beautiful glass jar! Believe that its abandonment is a last resort and helpless. It must have had a moment of shining, it has installed the most precious thing, it is a gift from heaven! Qianfenie is a professional enterprise that produces and sells kitchen supplies, and has always maintained its leading position in the industry. Since its establishment in 1978, it has been committed to integrating art and fashion into glass jar design, using advanced management models to manage product quality, and has formed a strict quality assurance system. Qianfenie Airtight Glass Jars FEATURES Material : Glass Color : Clear Bottom width: 4.5 inch Height : 5.9 inch Capacity : 32 ounce Quantity : 6 packs Package included : 6 glass jars + 3 replaceable silicone gaskets + 10 chalkboard labels + 1 chalkboard pen DESIGN High-quality thick glass Hinged lids and leak proof rubber gasket Sleek and transparent bottle body and wide mouth design Hinged Lids food jars, easy to open and close Easy clean: Hand wash or dishwasher NOTE To prevent leakage, each airtight glass jar has an extra free silicone gasket, which can be used as an alternative, or two can be used together. Since glassware products are fragile, please use warm water to soak this glass storage canisters. Do not put it directly in hot water to cause cracks. If for any reason you are not satisfied, please contact us immediately and we will ensure that you are absolutely satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ioabRGvlL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Qianfenie","source_asin":"B08JCXTYWH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-290506","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JCXTYWH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JCXTYWH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":290507,"name":"CafePress I Heart My Doberman Mug Ceramic Coffee Mug, Tea Cup 11 oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41kGuRhsOTL._AC_.jpg","description":"Perfect for your mid-morning pick me up a the office or for your decaf before the gym. This 11 ounce cup is an easy go-to mug for everyday use. Each of our beautiful mugs are printed by professionals in the USA with Lead-Free design for your safety. Whether you're drinking coffee, tea, or hot chocolate, this mug is perfect for you and your family. Our premium quality mugs are constructed of heat resistant ceramic and are dishwasher safe (top rack) and microwave safe. Choose your favorite coffee mug for women and men. Choose a quote mug for your best friend, a religious mug for your family, or a funny mug for your coworker. Whatever your hobby or passion, we are bound to have a mug for that.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41kGuRhsOTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CafePress","source_asin":"B08PN1Z1WH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-290507","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PN1Z1WH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PN1Z1WH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":290508,"name":"SIRIPHUM 20.5Inches Monogram Embroidered Letter Christmas Stocking Personalized Super Soft Christmas Stocking Hanging Decorations(A)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hcCXkhzfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Meterial:These beautiful Christmas stockings are Made with royal blue Velvet and Super Soft Plush Cuff.They are fully lined with polyester fabrics. Large size: Cuff to toe: 20.5 inch in length; cuff width:9 inch; proper size for giving enough space to put Christmas presents and candies Design:Personalize your stocking with unique and decorative embroidered letter. Features: Each Christmas stocking has 3.5” ribbon loop for easy hanging and display,for by the fireplace, mantel, wall, front door, banister, room or office, giving a traditional and classic look. Best christmas gift:Also they are perfect as adorable gifts for your family and friends. The christmas stockings brings a nice atmosphere in the Christmas, the child's interesting gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hcCXkhzfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SIRIPHUM","source_asin":"B0B1DK6VVR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-290508","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1DK6VVR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1DK6VVR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":290509,"name":"Now Designs Nova Stripe Kitchen Mat, Stripe Cactus","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zrKh8WqEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description For over 45-year Now Designs has created fashionable, fun, and functional kitchen textiles, table linens, gifts and decorative accessories for the home. Whether it's kitchen basics, fashion forward designs or gifts for any season, Now Designs' quality and workmanship is unsurpassed. Now Designs' durable Nova Kitchen Mats are hand-woven in India of 100-Percent cotton. Available in a variety of vibrant colors, Nova Kitchen Mats liven up your kitchen floor. Kitchen Mats measure 24 by 36-Inch and are machine washable. Amazon.com Now Designs Color Center Collection Now Designs has been creating beautiful and functional kitchen textiles and table linens for over 40 years. We design high quality aprons, mitts and dish towels in a wide selection of colors and patterns. At Now Designs we take color seriously! We share a love and passion for color. Our mission is to bring color to your kitchen. The Color Center is the foundation of Now Designs. It features a wide array of aprons, mitts, potholders, kitchen towels, dishcloths and kitchen rugs in twelve bright, beautiful colors. We invite you to mix, match and use your creativity and imagination to color your kitchen to reflect your style. Now Designs has got your kitchen covered. Our heavyweight aprons are built to last, and we've got dish towels for every use imaginable. Whether it's scrubbing, washing, drying or polishing, you'll find the best tool for the job in the Color Center. Aprons At Now Designs we've been making our aprons the same way for over 40 years. We start with strong, heavyweight 100% cotton twill, dyed with high quality color-fast dyes, cut it into the ideal classic apron shape and sew it together with high-strength bar-tacks at seven stress points. Put it all together and you've got an apron built to withstand the rigors and abuses of daily use in the busiest kitchens. The neck strap is adjustable for the perfect fit. One size fits all. Basic Mitts and Potholders Made from the same heavy weight twill as our aprons, our mitts and potholders are designed for comfort and heat protection. Utramitts and Ultragrips The Ultramitt and Ultragrip family features heat, steam, and flame-resistant silicone. Grab the hottest pan or dish with confidence. The Ultramitt & Ultragrip's unique pattern of raised squares keeps moisture off the contact surface. It's the same concept that keeps winter tires from slipping. They are made with silicone that has been bonded to cotton under extremely high pressure. The result is a high-tech material that combines the heat protection of silicone with the flexibility of cotton fabric. The Ultramitt's opposable-thumb design is engineered to provide the best fit for all hands, left and right. They are safe to machine wash and dry. Hang-up Towels This unique and highly absorbent 100% cotton towel comes with metal snap closures for hanging over your oven door handle. It comes out of the dryer in ready to use condition - no folding required! Floursack Dishtowels Often imitated, never duplicated, the Now Designs Floursack towel is simply the best for dying dishes and glasses. Perfect lint-free, streak-free drying every time. Generously sized at 20\"x30\". 100% cotton. Symmetry Dishtowels These soft and thirsty jacquard-woven towels are the quintessential multipurpose cloths. 100% cotton. 18\"x28\". Basketweave Dishtowels and Dishcloths These textured striped towels can do it all. Extra absorbent and durable, basketweave dishcloths make doing the dishes a breeze. 100% cotton. Towels are 16\"x25\". Cloths are 14\"x14\". Scrubby Dishcloths Soft cotton terry one side and scrubby mesh on the other, this dishcloth is on double duty. Great for glass and all cookware surfaces, these cloths are gentle but effective. 100% cotton terry with polyester mesh. 10\"x10\". Jumbo Dishtowels Big jobs need big towels. These extra large 24\"x36\" towels are great for drying pots and pans. Each set of three contains one plaid and two stripes. 100% cotton. Barmops Barmops are known for outstanding absorbency and durability. Perfect for wiping down kitchen counters and surfaces. 100% cotton. 16\"x18\". Ripple Towels Dry your hands in the kitchen with luxurious soft Turkish cotton. These thick and thirsty towels are made of the highest quality 100% cotton. 18\"x28\". Waffle Dishcloths These loosely-woven 100% cotton waffle-weave dishcloths are a terrific bargain and add a dash of color to your dish washing routine. Education without Borders A percentage of the profit on the sales of Now Designs product lines go to Education without Borders. The objective of the foundation is to foster educational opportunities and provide educational facilities in disadvantaged regions of the world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zrKh8WqEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Now Designs","source_asin":"B004T18P76","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-290509","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004T18P76","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004T18P76","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
