window.products.push({"id":290535,"name":"Quadro Frames 12.5x18 inch Picture Frame, Black, Style P375-3/8 inch Wide Molding","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ujaLgyOyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"All our picture frames are produced on demand at our facility in Spencer MA using our exclusive Quadro Frames molding system. Moldings are custom extruded to our specifications and consist of ABS plastic with a metallized mylar finish, they are virtually indistinguishable from a metal frame at a fraction of the cost. Backing panels are 0.10 inch thick MDF (Medium Density Fiberboard) - NOT cheap corrugated cardboard. Front panels are 0.040\" thick optically clear PET plastic with an opaque and/or blue protective peel away film applied to both sides. While assembling your frames make sure to peel off the protective film from BOTH sides of the plastic panel. The frames dimensions refer to the PANELS so that media of the specified size will fit in the frame. The external dimensions of the frame are 3/8 inch larger than nominal size. The visible image size (accounting for the overlap of the moldings over the panels) is 3/4 inch less than the nominal size. The moldings are side loading and in additional to the panels provided will accomodate 3/16 inches of media thickness. This is sufficient space for an image as well as a double standard thickness matteboard. All components are manufactured to the highest tolerances for a picture frame of seamless fit and finish. Assembly is required but consists simply of snapping four (4) corner connectors onto the moldings, no tools are required the frames literally snap together in seconds. The corner connectors fit onto the back side of the moldings and are not visible from the front or sides. The frames are designed to hang from the corner connectors, which include an arc shaped sawtooth pattern for fine levelling adjustment on the spot! These classic contemporary style picture frames are an excellent choice for framing virtually any image with a professional gallery look.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ujaLgyOyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Quadro Frames","source_asin":"B00XIMLJF2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-290535","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00XIMLJF2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00XIMLJF2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":290536,"name":"Brielle Home 630 Thread Count Egyptian Cotton Sateen Premium 600 Plus Sheet Set, California King, Linen Grey Stripe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xq+PCfVPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brielle Egyptian cotton sateen sheets bring sheer luxury to your bedroom with this 630 thread count sheet set. Constructed of soft Egyptian cotton, this sheet set will radiate tranquility into your room. What is Brielle is our exclusive home textiles brand. In Brielle distilled 60 years of expertise to deliver the best value in home textiles. We carry an extensive selection of bedding products with cotton, modal, Tencel/lyocell, bamboo fibers in sateen Jersey, twill, and percale weaves. The selection of fabric, size and color options often are not offered by local stores and delivered to your door at your convenience. We also carry a wide selection of window panels. Whether you are shopping for a sheet set, window panels or bathrobe, Brielle deliver the best product for your money. Luxury bedding and home textiles for factory prices. Guaranteed. What is cotton has been cultivated and used to make fabrics for at least 7,000 years. by weaving 630 single ply threads per square inch, this luxurious bedding has improved longevity and softness. Long-staple cottons are known for being supple, smooth and glossy. These fibers create sheets with a softer feel, a more lustrous shine and greater durability. Unlike polyester (polyester is also marketed in disguise as micro-fiber, ultra-fiber and Egyptian comfort) cotton is a natural fiber that is moisture-wicking and breathable. What is sateen is a type of weave incorporating more vertical than horizontal yarns, which results in an extremely soft fabric with a silky sheen. Sateen is a luxurious and eye-catching weave. SEARCH Brielle sheets for different softness, durability, and price options. We have something for every taste and budget.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xq+PCfVPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brielle Home","source_asin":"B078SKZ21W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-290536","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078SKZ21W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078SKZ21W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
