window.products.push({"id":290690,"name":"Alen FF50 Replacement Filter for the FIT50 Air Purifier - True HEPA Filter for Air Purifier for Allergens, Pollen, Dust, Dander, and Pet Fur, Long-Las","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71avuV70tWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designed for the Alen BreatheSmart FIT50 air purifier, the Alen HEPA-Pure filter combines two layers of filter technology to purify and freshen the air in your home. Polluted air first passes through Alen's vacuumable pre-filter to capture large particles, extending the life of the filter. In the second layer, air moves through a unique, electrostatically charged True HEPA material that attracts and captures dust, pollen, pet dander, mold spores and other airborne pollutants. Relief from allergy and asthma symptoms has never been so simple.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71avuV70tWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alen","source_asin":"B09L7LX5RW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-290690","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L7LX5RW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L7LX5RW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":290691,"name":"Toothbrush Holder SIMMOUDE Wall Mounted Toothbrush Holders for Bathroom with Automatic Toothpaste Dispenser Kids 8 Electric Toothbrush Holders Set 4 P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jKZ0viebL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Multifunctional Toothbrush Holder】 SIMMOUDE's toothbrush holder comes with a toothpaste squeezer,can hold 8 ordinary or electric toothbrushes, 4 cups (random colors), and the storage compartment above can store toothpaste, combs, razors, facial cleansers or other bathroom accessories.It is a convenient solution to save space on the bathroom sink countertop, with ultra-lightweight and compact size.It is a storage rack suitable for a family and kids to use together. 【Screw and Drill Free Self-Adhesive】 The toothbrush holder is equipped with 2 self-adhesive hooks. There is no need to drill or screw on the wall. Just tear off the sticker and stick it on a smooth, dry and clean wall which is easy to install. The toothpaste holder can also be pasted on the mirror or ceramic tile. Wait for a while after installation, the glue will stick more firmly and the shelf will be less likely to fall off, but only items with a total weight of less than 2kg can be placed. 【Practical Storage Rack for Home】 The inverted design of the cup on the toothbrush holder makes the cups easy to drain, dry after use, and avoid water stains. The toothbrush is covered by an upside-down cup, which will not be wet by water and dry quickly. At the same time, it is hung separately and equidistantly, which is a cleanliness and more convenient to use.In addition, the toothbrush holder is made of plastic, which is more durable and does not rust compared to stainless steel. 【Easy to Disassemble and Clean】 The toothbrush holder is easy to disassemble and reassemble, take down the entire shelf from the hook, and the cup holder on the shelf is also detachable. It can be directly washed with a rag or water, and can be quickly and easily hung back. The simple and clear structure can easily and conveniently keep the toothbrush holder clean every day. 【Convenient to Use and After Service】 The toothbrush holder is made of functional plastic, thick and translucent, simple and odorless. The cup can be used as a drinking cup with high temperature resistance. The edge is smooth and does not scratch your mouth and hands.If there are any problems with the product in use, please contact us,we will help you solve as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jKZ0viebL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SIMMOUDE","source_asin":"B09NM11CSZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-290691","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NM11CSZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NM11CSZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
