window.products.push({"id":290717,"name":"Magisor 100% Pure Copper Moscow Mule Mug (Set Of 2)(14.5 OZ)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819FyVgKKYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★Pure Copper Moscow Mule Mugs are best for cocktail. Vodka,  ginger beer, iced coffee, iced tea and a gin, rum, tequila,or whiskey mixed drinks. Magisor Moscow Mule Mugs are made of 100% Pure Copper and they are handmade by skilled artisans.  You can either buy them for your own use or give them to your friends as gifts. Wish our Magisor Mugs made your life better!   ★Copper is oxidized.Tarnishing is a naturally occurring process that happens  when copper reacts with outside elements.To get rid of the tarnish you  can use salt + vinegar to clean the mug.Copper mugs can be used for hot  beverages but they are not recommended.   ★Like any classic recipe worthy of respect, even the Moscow mule has its variation,  more or less acceptable to all kinds of deformation. Various changes are often  determinedby the fashion of the moment. If you use tequila instead of vodka, it is  \"El Burro\" or \"Mexican Burro\" (Mexican Burro). Then there is the \"Kentucky Mule\"  (Kentucky Mule), apparently with Bourbon Whiskey to prepare. There is also a popular  deformation is the use of gold wine (gin), that is, \"gold mule\" (GinGin Mule), it is actually  the perfect combination with ginger. Finally, before trying other types of deformation,  there are \"Dark and Stormy\" cocktails, which is a tropical version of this drink, using  black rum. Even this version is quite refreshing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819FyVgKKYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Magisor","source_asin":"B01LXX3LU2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-290717","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LXX3LU2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LXX3LU2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
