window.products.push({"id":290744,"name":"Chef Caddy Spice Rack Organizer for Countertop - Modular Seasoning Organizer with 2 Olive Oil Dispenser Bottles, Spouts & 12 Spice Containers - Plus C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81motzPDYeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Chef Caddy's ultimate spice storage organizer caddy was created by a meal prep master to make cooking quicker and easier for the seasoned home chef. Organized into vertical tiers, these modular spice racks are sleek, portable and align magnetically. The unique and innovative labelling system lets you organize your seasonings as you like or into 17 different flavor profiles. If you're planning an Italian night, just grab your \"Italian\" caddy to make cooking a breeze. This large \"bookend set\" also includes 2 large glass bottles with oil cruets (or spouts) to help make precise pours and prevent your counter and bottles from getting sticky. What's Included 3 x vertical spice rack caddy 12 x 3 oz spice jars with lids with both sifting and pouring options 2 x sauce/oil bottle caddy 2 x glass olive oil dispenser bottle 2 x oil pourer spout 1 x free cooking course on “freestyle” meal preparation Complete label set includes 224 Spice jar cap labels (216 pre-printed covering the quintessential spices for 17 world cuisines, 8 blanks to write your own) 42 Caddy top labels (36 pre-printed including 2 seasoning lists (spices, essentials) for each of 17 world cuisines, 6 blanks to write your own seasoning cheat sheets or recipes) 33 large 12oz bottle decals (printed with popular oils, vinegars, sauces) About Chef Caddy The idea for Chef Caddy came from Kitchen Karate creator Casey Moulton. As a seasoned chef, he designed the Kitchen Karate method to teach how to make 15 completely different meals in just 2 hours. Talk about ultimate meal prep! Part of his method included sorting spices by cuisine flavor profiles onto seasoning organizer \"cheat sheets\". Each one contained a different flavor profile - Mexican, Italian, Indian etc. His students raved about the idea and encouraged him to turn it into a product. The Chef Caddy was born.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81motzPDYeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chef Caddy Spice Rack","source_asin":"B08H4V1GGD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-290744","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H4V1GGD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H4V1GGD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
