window.products.push({"id":290782,"name":"GINGPROUS Mama Bear, Papa Bear Travel Tumbler Set, Gifts for New Parents Pregnancy New Mom and New Dad Couples, 20 Oz Insulated Stainless Steel Travel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.91,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WCM4W7aRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHAT DO YOU NEED: Do you want to give a surprise for your dad and mom? Would you like to show your love with her or his by using a funny set of tumblers? The mama bear and papa bear insulated wine tumbler with lid and straw is the wonderful choice! DOUBLE WALL VACUUM INSULATION: This mama bear and papa bear travel tumbler set can keep the beverage at the ideal temperature (hot or cold) for a long time. According to our tests, it can keep hot for 5 hours, and keep cold for 9 hours. Whether it's summer or winter, you can always taste drinks with the temperature you like. DURABLE STAINLESS STEEL DESIGN: The High-quality stainless steel material can keep the couple gift travel tumbler surface dry all the time. In addition, the strong stainless steel material ensures that you can use this travel tumbler for a long time. BPA FREE LID: The BPA Free lids and 18/8 food grade stainless steel material can ensure that this insulated travel tumbler is completely safe for you and will not leave a bad metallic taste in your mouth. The lid with rubber gasket makes this travel tumbler have a good seal and easy to carry. MULTIFUNCTIONAL TRAVEL TUMBLER: The stainless steel travel tumbler is suitable for wine, beer, cocktails, champagne, water, coffee, tea, milk, juice and more. Whether you are indoors or outdoors, enjoy your drinking moments without other concerns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WCM4W7aRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GINGPROUS","source_asin":"B09KLXBLP7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-290782","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KLXBLP7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KLXBLP7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":290783,"name":"HLC.ME Andersen Buffalo Check Plaid 100% Blackout Thermal Insulated Energy Savings Heat/Cold Blocking Window Grommet Curtain Drapery Panels for Bedroo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91BZ0maXAnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking to add a dash of elegance to your living spaces while improving comfort? With these extreme Blackout Curtains from HLC.ME, the beauty is much more than skin deep. Beyond the stunning design and array of fashionable colors, our thermal, insulated curtain panels block out disruptive light and help maintain a comfortable temperature in your home. Light blocking Thermal insulated for heat / cool air retention Premium, Thermal Bond Fabric Beautiful, no-fade jacquard plaid design Sturdy metal grommets (not plastic) Wide array of colors and sizes available For indoor use only Studies show that light from outside can be detrimental to our sleep and the thin, sheer curtains that are highly popular today aren't much help. These Andersen Blackout Curtains from HLC.ME allow you to infuse your home with supreme style while creating a sleep sanctuary in your master bedroom , child's bedroom , or nursery . The secret of our curtain panels is our innovative thermal bond material, which effectively blocks light from shining through (100% of light, in fact). Our blackout curtains are sturdy without being too heavy and bulky and provide a high-end decorative touch. Feel like warm or cool air just goes right out the window (along with your hard-earned money)? HLC.ME Blackout Curtains are the ideal complement to your efforts to conserve energy at home. Each panel features a thin thermal lining woven together into one layer to prevent heat and cold air from entering your home, keeping your living spaces at a comfortable temperature all year long. Machine washable: Dust build-up or stains on your curtains? No need to fret; simply toss the panels into the washing machine on the cold, delicate cycle and use a mild detergent (no bleach). You can even dry them in the dryer on a low setting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91BZ0maXAnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HLC.ME","source_asin":"B08J9SY796","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-290783","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08J9SY796","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08J9SY796","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
