window.products.push({"id":290878,"name":"ICONIQ Stainless Steel Insulated Tumbler Mug with Built-in Handle and Splash Proof Lid | 20 Ounce | Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qBVgiR3nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DOUBLE WALLED VACUUM INSULATION: Keep your cold drinks COLD for up to 12 hours and hot drinks HOT for up to 6 hours! Keep your hands sweat-free and dry instead of burning or freezing. EASY TO GRIP HANDLE: Our minimalist handle design allows you to hang on to your coffee cup no matter what you are doing. 18/8 STAINLESS STEEL: Take a swig out of our tumblers without fear of toxic chemicals! We only use 18/8 food grade stainless steel. PRESS ON LID: With an easy to clean, BPA-FREE press-on lid, you can travel with your mug anywhere. The non-toxic silicone o-rings and mouthpiece cover keeps your mug spill proof. LIFETIME GUARANTEE: We invite you to try our insulated mug RISK-FREE for 30 days! ALL ICONIQ products are back by a Limited Lifetime Warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qBVgiR3nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ICONIQ","source_asin":"B07VYBW6VM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-290878","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VYBW6VM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VYBW6VM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":290879,"name":"Spode Christmas Tree 2005 Annual Collector Plate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51290Y50W1L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Christmas Tree was originally introduced in 1938, designed specifically for the American market. It is the oldest holiday pattern in the US today, and is loved by collectors for its nostalgia and warm recollections of past Christmases. Amazon.com Since 1938 Spode's Christmas Tree pattern has delighted families and collectors world-wide. Every year Spode brings out an eight-inch, limited edition Christmas Tree plate inscribed with the current year. Bells are the theme of 2005; four pairs of golden bells alternate with evergreen boughs to create a festive border. In the center of the plate, above the date, stands the famous Spode tree, fully ornamented and topped by a tiny Father Christmas. All Spode dishes are made in England of exceptionally high-quality earthenware, known as Imperialware, which is safe for both the dishwasher and microwave. Perfect for serving cookies and holiday treats, or honored by itself on a mantelpiece, the annual plate makes a superb gift for the Spode Christmas Tree collector. Spode packages the plate in its signature red holiday box. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51290Y50W1L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spode","source_asin":"B0009W7Q3I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-290879","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0009W7Q3I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0009W7Q3I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":290880,"name":"Sheikha Bakhoor Tablet - 45 GM (1.6 oz)| A Hearty Combination of Fruity and Floral Notes| Clean Fragrance| Long Lasting Fragrance| Royal Scent |Season","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91EQ4V8ENfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Excellent Quality and Value Bakhoor by Al Haramain. Comes in tablet form, and is easily broken up into powder. Bakhoor is the name given to woodchips soaked in fragrant oils. These are then burned in incense burners to perfume the home and clothing. The bukhoor weaves together an aromatic bouquet of raw materials such as sandalwood, frankincense and mixture of the essence of Oudh, Sandlewood, Amber, Rose etc. One could light this and relax in the fragrance - so beautiful it was conducive to remembering A Poem \"Abou ben Adhem\" - he was an Arabian gentleman who saw an Angel writing in a Book of Gold Method of burning Bakhoor Take a piece of arab coal and heat a corner of it with a small flame in incense burner or suitable metal dish. Wait for 2 minutes, then sprinkle a small amount of Bakhoor incense on to hot coal. Sit back as the beautiful fragrance fills the room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91EQ4V8ENfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Al Haramain","source_asin":"B009YWF0XC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-290880","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009YWF0XC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009YWF0XC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
