window.products.push({"id":290890,"name":"Holymood Scratch Free Cutting Board Set, 2-piece Non-Scratch TPU Flexible Cutting Boards for Knife Friendly, Chopping Mat with Juice Grooves, BPA Free","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RjRIb8JLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"😀【No cutting marks】 TPU is known for its abrasion resistance and resistance to deformation, so it is the least likely to leave knife marks among all material cutting boards, solving the problem of cutting boards dropping slag or food left in the knife marks. And tpu is a recyclable, BPA-free environmentally friendly materials, durable, high temperature resistance. ✌️【Flexibility】 Can be bent at will and can be quickly restored to its original shape after bending, making it easy to pour chopped food into the pan. Non-porous cutting board, soft material, knife friendly, its own material has non-slip properties, so when using the cutting board will not slide around. 🏕️【Space saving】High quality thin and light TPU cutting board that can be tucked into crevices or backpacks freely, it will also be a good helper for your camping or RV. Try this TPU cutting board by replacing the poor quality plastic flakes. 13.27×9.84 inch ✋【Design details】Easy Grip Handle, Juice grooves to prevent juice spills and keep the countertop clean. With a scale to help control the size of the dough or other food that needs to be measured. 😊【Satisfaction Service】Providing 100% customer satisfaction after-sales service is very important to us. If there is any damage or problem with the product you received, please feel free to contact Holymood service team.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RjRIb8JLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOLYMOOD","source_asin":"B09NM3RJLX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-290890","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NM3RJLX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NM3RJLX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":290891,"name":"FAAY 13.5” Stir Fry Wooden Spatula for LEFT Hand, Ergonomic Handle Saute Paddle, Healthy Wood Turner, Handcraft from High Moist Resistance Golden Teak","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RdqYiu-PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% CAREFREE COOKING EXPERIENCE Our FAAY Teak Stir Fry Spatulas / Turners are made of 100% golden brown teak. They are moist resistant, yet lightweight and handy. They will not bend or break easily, so we assure you can stir large quantity of ingredients. Our handy handle, wide and thin wooden blade, and the curve that easily gets to the angle allow you to flip everything effortlessly. Moreover, our ergonomic design creates curved edges protecting your precious cookware. 100% ECO-FRIENDLY AND HEALTHY Our FAAY Teak Spatulas / Turners are from sustainable source of teaks in Thailand. Teaks are well known to be heat and moist resistant. Please be noted that the product color depends on types of soil (It can be either dark or light golden brown). No glue or lacquer added, only coconut oil finished. This is just to ensure our valuable customers’ good health. 100% HANDMADE AND HEARTCRAFTED BY LOCAL ARTISANS Most of the wooden utensils nowadays are machinemade. Every piece of our products helps the local artisans maintain their remarkable craft skill and pass it down to the next generations. They are genuine artists, and they just need a little space to express their talent. Only you can provide them with that. 100% EASY TO TAKE CARE OF Wash them with warm water and soft sponge to preserve their qualities. We recommend you dry them by hanging. If there is something sticking to our spatulas, just put them in the water for 5 minutes before washing. Please store them in dry place when not used. When teak products are exposed to oil and heat, their color normally becomes darker, but they are still perfectly useable. 100% WARRANTY GUARANTEED In case our spatulas do not come in their best condition like in the photo or get broken after being used for 30 days, just let us know. We sincerely apologize and will definitely send you the new ones in no time. We appreciate all your remarks and comments. They are the key tools to develop and improve our handmade and heartcrafted products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RdqYiu-PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FAAY","source_asin":"B083XGHFQW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-290891","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083XGHFQW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083XGHFQW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":290892,"name":"Ivy Lane Design Ceramic Greek Alphabet Dish, Alpha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5171MCKsLTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Ceramic Greek Letter Dishes are available in 24 Greek alphabet characters. Well crafted for long life. From sorority and fraternity parties, to education celebrations, or to recognize a part of your life experience at a reunion or wedding. You can even use them to teach the Greek alphabet! From Ivy Lane Design, creating special days by design.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5171MCKsLTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ivy Lane Design","source_asin":"B00KA6SKEM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-290892","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KA6SKEM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KA6SKEM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":290893,"name":"Polish Pottery Salad Plate 9-inch Butterleaf UNIKAT","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yMt-6tk+L._AC_.jpg","description":"Polish Pottery Plate 9-inch Butterleaf UNIKAT Dimensions: 9¼\" wide, 9¼\" long, 1\" high Polmedia Polish Pottery Stoneware is: * Hand crafted and hand painted in Boleslawiec, Poland * Microwave safe, dishwasher safe, oven safe up to 480 F, freezer safe * Lead and cadmium free * Crack and chip resistant * Intended for everyday use, easy to clean * Highly collectable About Polish Pottery Polish pottery is known for its versatility in the kitchen and on the table. It is safe for use with food in the microwave, freezer, oven and dishwasher. Polish stoneware is resilient to abrasives making it durable and resistant to scratching or chipping. It distributes heat evenly for perfect baking and is also nonstick for easy clean-up, making it easy to care for. The bright patterns never fade, and are offered in thousands of variations to mix and match. It is this combination of function and beauty that makes Polish pottery so appealing. The pottery is fired in electric and gas kilns at temperatures exceeding 2200 degrees Fahrenheit. This results in a stoneware that is meant to resist aging and provide lasting beauty that stands the test of time. Polish stoneware is lead and cadmium free.Polish Pottery is hand crafted and hand painted in the Boleslawiec region of Poland. This region is famous for its naturally found white clay which artisans have used for centuries to craft this durable and beautiful stoneware. Each piece of pottery is carefully formed and painted by hand to ensure that exceptional attention to detail is paid to each piece. The most beautiful and intricate patterns are called UNIKAT patterns. These patterns bear the artist’s signature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yMt-6tk+L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Polmedia Polish Pottery","source_asin":"B00KWM7VV2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-290893","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KWM7VV2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KWM7VV2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
